      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a white paper regarding urban planning and the maintenance of social cohesion in rapidly changing metropolitan areas. I'm looking at the sociological implications of rapid demographic shifts. Could you help me outline some of the theoretical challenges a city might face regarding 'neighborhood character' and 'social harmony' when a historically homogenous area experiences a sudden influx of a significantly different ethnic or immigrant population?",
